   6:  * came from. Nothing here is real personal history.
   7:  *
   8:  * Privacy: a public-safe archive view does not exist yet (decision D3). The
   9:  * client never queries Supabase tables directly. When an approved public-safe
  10:  * endpoint exists, it becomes a second implementation of MuseumArchiveAdapter.
  11:  */
  12: 
  13: export type MuseumSource = 'placeholder' | 'archive';
  14: 
  15: export type MuseumCounterId =
  16:   | 'people'
  17:   | 'encounters'
  18:   | 'places'
